#: ../../../reference/commands/workspace.rst:132
msgid ""
"The new ``conan workspace open`` command implements a new concept. The "
"packages containing an ``scm`` information in the ``conandata.yml`` (with "
"``git.coordinates_to_conandata()``) can be automatically cloned and checkout "
"inside the current workspace from their Conan recipe reference (including "
"recipe revision)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/commands/workspace.rst:136
msgid ""
"The optional ``--folder`` argument can be used together with an explicit "
"reference to control the relative path (to the workspace root) where the "
"package will be cloned. Subfolders are allowed, e.g. ``--folder=libs/mypkg``:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/commands/workspace.rst:139
msgid "$ conan workspace open mypkg/1.0 --folder=libs/mypkg"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/commands/workspace.rst:144
msgid ""
"If ``conan workspace open`` is called without a reference argument, it will "
"read the current ``conanws`` file and automatically open every package it "
"defines whose folder doesn't already exist yet, cloning each one into its "
"workspace-defined path:"
msgstr ""

