#: ../../../reference/commands/workspace.rst:216
msgid ""
"The command ``conan workspace super-install`` is useful to install and build "
"the current workspace as a monolithic super-project of the editables."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/commands/workspace.rst:219
msgid ""
"By default it uses all the ``editable`` packages in the workspace. It is "
"possible to select only a subset of them with the ``conan workspace super-"
"install --pkg=pkg_name1 --pkg=pkg_name2`` optional arguments. Only the "
"subgraph of those packages, including their dependencies and transitive "
"dependencies will be installed."
msgstr ""

